# Optional. Enables the "Sign in with Google" button on the login page; username/password
# login works without it.
#
# Two things have to line up or Google refuses with "the given origin is not allowed for
# the given client ID":
#   - this must be the same client ID as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID on the backend
#   - this app's origin (http://localhost:5173 in dev, plus the deployed URL) must be listed
#     under "Authorised JavaScript origins" for that client ID in Google Cloud Console
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
